#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.8.0.rst:136
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Migratiechecklist"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.8.0.rst:138
msgid ""
"Pass arguments by keyword (or in the documented positional order), "
"especially ``color`` on the drawing methods (:ref:`the argument-order change"
" <v2_8_0_argorder>`), and remove ``image.mask_ellipse()`` calls (:ref:`the "
"mask_ellipse removal <v2_8_0_maskellipse>`). All other scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Geef argumenten per keyword mee (of in de gedocumenteerde positionele "
"volgorde), met name ``color`` op de tekenmethoden (\\ :ref:`de "
"argumentvolgorde-wijziging <v2_8_0_argorder>`\\ ), en verwijder "
"``image.mask_ellipse()``\\ -aanroepen (\\ :ref:`de mask_ellipse-verwijdering"
" <v2_8_0_maskellipse>`\\ ). Alle overige scripts draaien ongewijzigd."
